{"4387440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Late Night Fears", "steam_appid": 4387440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Late Night Fears features three different horror experiences, each with its own setting, gameplay mechanics, and story. Every map is a self contained scenario, perfect for short but intense horror sessions.</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Infected Store</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A disturbing supermarket experience set during a pandemic.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Serve customers, restock shelves, and keep your boss happy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Figure out who is infected and who is not.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387440/extras/cf2b436a2d3e8e62b086817f5ad74e8f.poster.avif?t=1787939277\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387440/extras/cf2b436a2d3e8e62b086817f5ad74e8f.webm?t=1787939277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387440/extras/cf2b436a2d3e8e62b086817f5ad74e8f.mp4?t=1787939277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grandpa's Food Window</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A story driven horror cooking experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Serve burgers, fries, nuggets, and coffee...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>But the customers are not quite 